<div class="grid"><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><h2>🔥 Live Campaigns</h2><span class="tag">LIVE</span></div><div class="tokens"><div class="token"><div class="coin">R</div><div><b>$RUGCX · RUGCIRCUS</b><small>1,284 raiders · 8,421 actions</small></div><div class="score">82%</div></div><div class="token"><div class="coin">M</div><div><b>$MEME · MEME MACHINE</b><small>642 raiders · 3,214 actions</small></div><div class="score">67%</div></div><div class="token"><div class="coin">C</div><div><b>$CLOWN · CLOWNDAO</b><small>391 raiders · 1,882 actions</small></div><div class="score">54%</div></div></div></div>
<div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><h2>⚔️ Featured Raid</h2><span class="tag">$RUGCX</span></div><div class="raid"><div class="raidTitle"><div><div class="live">● LIVE RAID</div><h3>RUGCIRCUS — THE MAIN EVENT</h3><span class="muted">Target: X + TikTok + Telegram</span></div><b>82%</b></div><div class="bar"><i></i></div><div class="raidBtns"><button class="primary" onclick="toast('X raid opened')">🐦 Join X Raid</button><button class="secondary" onclick="toast('TikTok raid opened')">🎵 TikTok Raid</button><button class="secondary" onclick="toast('Telegram opened')">💬 Telegram</button></div></div></div></div>
<div class="sponsor"><div><b>🎪 SPONSORED OFFER</b><span>Discover today's offer from the Circus sponsor network.</span></div><a href="#" onclick="event.preventDefault();toast('Sponsor link placeholder — connect Monetag SmartLink in deployment')">VISIT OFFER ↗</a></div>
<div class="grid"><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><h2>🐦 X Live Feed</h2><span class="tag">POSTS · REPLIES · QUOTES</span></div><div class="social"><article class="post"><div class="postTop"><b>@rugcircusHQ</b><span>2m</span></div><p>THE CIRCUS IS OPEN 🎪 $RUGCX — who's stepping into the ring?</p><div class="postActions"><button class="tiny" onclick="toast('Reply composer opened')">Reply</button><button class="tiny" onclick="toast('Repost action')">Repost</button><button class="tiny" onclick="toast('Quote composer opened')">Quote</button><span class="tiny">♥ 184 · ↻ 71 · 💬 39</span></div></article><article class="post"><div class="postTop"><b>@crypto_demon</b><span>8m</span></div><p>Found the loudest circus on Solana today. 🎪</p><div class="postActions"><button class="tiny" onclick="toast('X post opened')">Open on X</button><span class="tiny">♥ 92 · ↻ 33</span></div></article></div></div>
<div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><h2>🎵 TikTok Activity</h2><span class="tag">VIDEO · PHOTO</span></div><div class="social"><article class="post"><div class="postTop"><b>@clownalpha</b><span>11m</span></div><p>When the token raid actually becomes a circus. 🎪🔥</p><div class="postActions"><button class="tiny" onclick="toast('TikTok video opened')">Watch Video</button><button class="tiny" onclick="toast('TikTok raid opened')">Join Raid</button></div></article><article class="post"><div class="postTop"><b>@solmemes</b><span>17m</span></div><p>Photo post · $RUGCX backstage pass.</p><div class="postActions"><button class="tiny" onclick="toast('TikTok post opened')">Open Post</button></div></article></div></div></div>
</section>
<section class="page" id="page-explore"><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><div><div class="eyebrow">TOKEN DIRECTORY</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin-top:7px">Explore the Circus</h2></div><span class="tag">SOLANA</span></div><div class="tokens" id="tokenList"></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-create"><div class="grid"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">CAMPAIGN BUILDER</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin:8px 0 20px">Put Your Token in the Circus</h2><div class="form"><label>Contract Address<input id="ca" placeholder="Paste Solana token address"></label><label>X Post URL<input placeholder="https://x.com/.../status/..." ></label><label>TikTok URL<input placeholder="https://www.tiktok.com/@.../video/..." ></label><label>Telegram<input placeholder="https://t.me/..." ></label><label>Campaign Duration<select><option>24 hours</option><option>48 hours</option><option>7 days</option></select></label></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">PROMOTION PACKAGES</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin:8px 0 20px">Choose Your Front Row</h2><div class="plans"><div class="plan"><b>FEATURED</b><strong>0.05 SOL</strong><p>Featured placement for 24h.</p><button class="secondary" onclick="openPay('FEATURED','0.05')">Select</button></div><div class="plan featured"><b>MEGA RAID</b><strong>0.10 SOL</strong><p>X + TikTok + Telegram campaign.</p><button class="primary" onclick="openPay('MEGA RAID','0.10')">Select</button></div><div class="plan"><b>FRONT ROW</b><strong>0.25 SOL</strong><p>Premium placement + analytics.</p><button class="secondary" onclick="openPay('FRONT ROW','0.25')">Select</button></div></div><p class="muted" style="font-size:11px;margin-top:18px">Payment flow is designed for Solana wallet verification. Connect the real treasury wallet and transaction verification in deployment.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-leaderboard"><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><div><div class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin-top:7px">Top Raiders</h2></div><span class="tag">THIS WEEK</span></div><div class="table"><div class="row"><span class="rank">1</span><b>@crypto_demon</b><strong>184 pts</strong></div><div class="row"><span class="rank">2</span><b>@solmaxi</b><strong>161 pts</strong></div><div class="row"><span class="rank">3</span><b>@moonclown</b><strong>143 pts</strong></div><div class="row"><span class="rank">4</span><b>@degenlord</b><strong>119 pts</strong></div><div class="row"><span class="rank">5</span><b>@circusape</b><strong>101 pts</strong></div></div></div></section>
</main>
<div class="modal" id="payModal"><div class="modalBox"><button class="close" onclick="closePay()">×</button><div class="eyebrow">SOL CHECKOUT</div><h2 id="payTitle">FEATURED</h2><p class="muted">Amount: <b id="payAmount">0.05 SOL</b></p><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">Connect a Solana wallet, send the exact amount to the configured RUGCIRCUS treasury, then the backend verifies the transaction before activating the campaign.</p><button class="primary" style="width:100%;margin-top:10px" onclick="payNow()">Pay & Activate</button></div></div>
<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>
</div>
<script>
const tokens=[['RUGCX','RUGCIRCUS','1,284 raiders','82%'],['MEME','MEME MACHINE','642 raiders','67%'],['CLOWN','CLOWNDAO','391 raiders','54%'],['VIRALW','VIRALWIRE','219 raiders','48%'],['PONZI','PONZI CIRCUS','173 raiders','41%']];
const pages=['home','explore','create','leaderboard'];
function showPage(p){pages.forEach(x=>{document.getElementById('page-'+x).classList.toggle('active',x===p)});document.querySelectorAll('.nav button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.page===p));window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})}
document.querySelectorAll('[data-page]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>showPage(b.dataset.page)));
document.querySelectorAll('[data-page-link]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>showPage(b.dataset.pageLink)));
document.getElementById('tokenList').innerHTML=tokens.map((t,i)=>`<div class="token"><div class="coin">${t[0][0]}</div><div><b>$${t[0]} · ${t[1]}</b><small>${t[2]} · live social activity</small></div><div><div class="score">${t[3]}</div><button class="tiny" onclick="toast('Token page for $${t[0]} opened')">View</button></div></div>`).join('');
function toast(msg){const t=document.getElementById('toast');t.textContent=msg;t.classList.add('show');setTimeout(()=>t.classList.remove('show'),2200)}
let treasury=null;
async function loadConfig(){
  try{
    const r=await fetch('/api/config');
    const data=await r.json();
    treasury=data.treasury||null;
    const sponsor=document.querySelector('.sponsor a');
    if(data.monetagSmartLink&&sponsor){sponsor.href=data.monetagSmartLink;sponsor.onclick=null}
    const hint=document.getElementById('treasuryHint');
    if(hint) hint.textContent=treasury?'Treasury: '+treasury:'Treasury wallet: configure PUBLIC_TREASURY_WALLET';
  }catch(e){}
}
async function connect(){
  if(!window.solana||!window.solana.isPhantom){toast('Install or open a Solana wallet such as Phantom');return}
  try{
    const res=await window.solana.connect();
    document.getElementById('wallet').textContent=res.publicKey.toString().slice(0,4)+'…'+res.publicKey.toString().slice(-4);
    toast('Wallet connected');
  }catch(e){toast('Wallet connection cancelled')}
}
function openPay(name,amount){document.getElementById('payTitle').textContent=name;document.getElementById('payAmount').textContent=amount+' SOL';document.getElementById('payModal').classList.add('open')}
function closePay(){document.getElementById('payModal').classList.remove('open')}
async function payNow(){
  if(!treasury){toast('Payment wallet is not configured');return}
  if(!window.solana||!window.solana.isPhantom){toast('Connect a Solana wallet first');return}
  try{
    const res=await window.solana.connect();
    const connection=new solanaWeb3.Connection('https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com','confirmed');
    const lamports=Math.round(pay.amount*1e9);
    const tx=new solanaWeb3.Transaction().add(solanaWeb3.SystemProgram.transfer({fromPubkey:res.publicKey,toPubkey:new solanaWeb3.PublicKey(treasury),lamports}));
    const signed=await window.solana.signAndSendTransaction(tx);
    toast('Transaction sent — verifying…');
    const vr=await fetch('/api/payment/verify',{method:'POST',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({signature:signed.signature,expectedLamports:lamports})});
    const result=await vr.json();
    if(result.ok){closePay();toast('Payment verified — campaign can activate');}
    else toast(result.error||'Payment verification failed');
  }catch(e){toast(e?.message||'Payment failed')}
}
document.getElementById('wallet').addEventListener('click',connect);
loadConfig();
</script>
</body>
</html>